### Identity Theft

- medical theft
  Medical identity theft occurs when someone uses your personal information to obtain medical services or goods. This can include using your health insurance information to receive medical care, prescription drugs, or surgery.

- banking and credit card theft
  Banking and credit card identity theft occurs when someone uses your personal information to access your bank account or credit card. This can include using your account number, PIN, or other personal information to make unauthorized transactions.

